Was my favorite of the many merge games until; 
- only rewards are the stupid purple speed ups. No energy. They never reward you with energy. And have 4 layers of ours to merge to make a difficult item with difficult items with no energy boosts or rewards to catch. 15 energy is basically nothing for the items required. Became frustrated work. Other merge games keep it fun and challenging to keep playing. Disappointed 
- SpongeBob theme (off putting, not good themed or cute, in fact gross items undelightful..)
